### 4.3 抽取明细批量状态更新

建议新加一个私有方法，收掉 `confirmBatch` / `markPaid` / `reverseBatch` 的重复逻辑。

```java
private void updateAllDetailsStatus(Long batchId, String targetStatus, Instant now,
        boolean keepReversedUnchanged, boolean setSettledAt, boolean setReversedAt) {
    List<RewardSettlementDetailEntity> details = detailMapper.selectList(
            new LambdaQueryWrapper<RewardSettlementDetailEntity>()
                    .eq(RewardSettlementDetailEntity::getDeletedFlag, DELETED_FLAG_NOT_DELETED)
                    .eq(RewardSettlementDetailEntity::getBatchId, batchId));

    for (RewardSettlementDetailEntity detail : details) {
        if (keepReversedUnchanged && STATUS_REVERSED.equals(detail.getStatus())) {
            continue;
        }
        detail.setStatus(targetStatus);
        if (setSettledAt) {
            detail.setSettledAt(now);
        }
        if (setReversedAt) {
            detail.setReversedAt(now);
        }
        detail.setUpdatedAt(now);
        detailMapper.updateById(detail);
    }
}
```

然后调用方式变成：

```java
updateAllDetailsStatus(batchId, STATUS_CONFIRMED, now, true, true, false);
updateAllDetailsStatus(batchId, STATUS_PAID, now, true, false, false);
updateAllDetailsStatus(batchId, STATUS_REVERSED, now, false, false, true);
```

这样改完后，三段状态流转代码会明显短很多。

